ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nUncle Li works in a large company for many years, he believes that a stable job is the best. His son, Xiao Li, is passionate about starting a business and hopes to convince Uncle Li to understand the value and significance of entrepreneurship.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Xiao Li convince Uncle Li?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Li can share some successful entrepreneurial stories, such as Jack Ma, Zhang Yiming, etc., to show that entrepreneurship can bring great achievements.\nB. Xiao Li can organize a family meeting, let the family discuss together and give Uncle Li more confidence.\nC. Xiao Li can show Uncle Li how his business plan meets current and future market needs.\nD. Xiao Li can promise to regularly report the progress of the business to Uncle Li, making Uncle Li feel involved and at ease.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0011694883144390425,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e18cd6006945d27ffb81","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367884993,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:24","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7e398cabea3e41cc8bc66058eb403eae"}